<?php
return ['name' => 'empowered_gui_water_the_sage', 'displayTitle' => ['en' => 'Empowered Gui Water – The Sage', 'zh' => '身强癸水'], 'locales' => ['en' => ['sections' => ['overview' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>Gui Water is likened to rain and dew. When empowered (strong in energy), Empowered Gui Water surges freely, gifting it with sharp intelligence and insight to keenly sense its environment and emerging trends. Its journey is to realize that countless raindrops need guidance to converge into a river before they can wield great power.True strength isn\'t found in wild, scattered torrents, but in guiding, integrating, and pooling its talents. By focusing its flow, even gentle drizzles of effort can unite into an unstoppable flood.</p><p>Quick Insight: Your mind is agile and perceptive. You adapt swiftly and excel at strategizing, easily seeing the bigger picture.<br/>Resilient & Decisive: Inside, you\'re tenacious and bold. You act with confidence and power, though for major decisions it\'s wise to gather input from others and remain flexible.<br/>Subtle Authority: You may appear carefree, but you carry a strong desire to be in control. In areas that matter to you, your laid-back exterior conceals a powerful will to lead.</p>'], 'love' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>Empowered Gui Water benefits from Wood, Fire, and Earth elements. Empowered Gui Water is like a heavy rain that nourishes everything, yet its energy can disperse in all directions. By drawing on Wood, Fire, and Earth elements, you gain stability and focus.</p>'], 'career' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<h4>Wealth</h4><p>You do best building wealth through steady, reliable work rather than quick schemes. Stay disciplined and methodical — avoid jumping between ventures or spreading your resources too thin. Consistent effort and focus will pay off for you financially.</p><h4>Health</h4><p>Pay attention to your kidney function by limiting excess salt and staying hydrated. Protect your joints by avoiding prolonged sitting or standing, and prioritize quality sleep and a regular schedule to maintain your energy.</p><h4>Emotional Wellbeing</h4><p>You can sometimes slip into all-or-nothing thinking or intense moods. Vigorous exercise is an excellent outlet — try activities like mountain hiking or boxing to blow off steam. Physical challenges help ground your energy and prevent you from getting stuck in extreme thoughts.</p><h4>Career Pathways</h4><p>Where You Flourish: Construction & Urban Planning: Civil engineering, architectural design, real estate development, project management, city planning. Energy & Engineering: Power engineering, petrochemicals, new energy technology. Finance & Law: Judge, lawyer, auditor, tax specialist. Technology & Manufacturing: Software development, electronics, mechanical engineering, automotive industry. Creative & Education: Writer, screenwriter, advertising strategist, film director, brand manager, educator. Public Service & Management: Government roles in infrastructure or resource management, corporate executive, project manager. Where Energy Feels Drained: Marine & Seafaring: Fishing, aquaculture, naval navigation, crew roles. Trade & Logistics: Import-export trade, courier/delivery services. Freelance Work: Long-term solo freelancing may not suit your need for structure and collaboration.</p>'], 'relationship_friends' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Wu Earth friends help channel your excess energy into practical outlets. They encourage more realism and bolster your stress tolerance.</li><li>Bing Fire friends ignite your motivation and help you set clear goals when your focus starts to scatter.</li></ul>'], 'relationship_couple' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Yi Wood partner balances your intensity and sparks your creativity. Their gentle flexibility can temper your forcefulness and inspire new ideas.</li><li>Ding Fire partner melts away your water\'s chill, helping you open up emotionally. They infuse you with warmth and empathy, making you more compassionate and emotionally balanced.</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_international' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Mother Teresa: Nobel Peace Prize laureate, remembered worldwide for her unwavering compassion and humanitarian service.</li><li>Hayao Miyazaki: Legendary Japanese animator and filmmaker, whose works carry strong environmental themes; personally funded the preservation of forests and cultural heritage in Japan.</li><li>Simone de Beauvoir: Author of the feminist classic The Second Sex, who revealed how “woman is made, not born,” and became a global voice for gender equality.</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_domestic' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Wang Shi: Founder of Vanke, recognized as a pioneering entrepreneur who reshaped China’s real estate industry.</li><li>Wang Jianlin: Chairman of Wanda Group, a business titan whose empire spans real estate, entertainment, and global investments.</li><li>Zhang Chaoyang: Founder of Sohu, one of China’s earliest internet leaders who helped shape the country’s digital age.</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_dailyTips' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Listen to heavy metal music to boost your energy and confidence</li><li>Chew mint-flavored gum to steady your nerves and clear your mind</li><li>Include more white-colored foods in your diet for balance</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_color' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Yellow (Earth): Symbolizes stability and a strong foundation. Yellow can reinforce your steadiness, making your actions more grounded and reliable. Surround yourself with touches of yellow to feel supported and confident.</li><li>Red & Purple (Fire): Red represents passion and drive, while purple signifies courage and inspiration. These fiery colors ignite your motivation, helping Empowered Gui Water be more decisive and efficient when it counts. Use red or purple accents in your life to keep your momentum and enthusiasm high.</li><li>Green & Teal (Wood): The colors of growth and open skies. For Empowered Gui Water, these tones expand your vision and boost communication, turning big ideas into flowing action. Add leafy greens, jade jewelry, or teal décor into your space to keep inspiration fresh and energy moving.</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_location' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>South (Fire): Represents motivation and efficiency. Facing south energizes you, boosting your productivity and helping you tackle tasks with zeal.</li><li>East (Wood): Represents growth and creativity. Facing east stimulates fresh ideas and innovation, encouraging you to be more creative and forward-thinking in your decisions.</li></ul>']]], 'zh' => ['sections' => ['overview' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>癸水为雨露，身强则水性奔腾，具备智慧与洞察力，能敏锐感知环境与趋势。身强癸水的修炼在于领悟，落下的雨滴只有经过引导汇聚成河，才能形成势力壮大的水流。真正的力量不在于散漫奔腾，而在于引导、整合与汇聚，使涓涓细流最终汇成不可阻挡的洪流。</p><p>敏捷洞察：思维敏捷，洞察力强，处事灵活多变，擅长谋略布局。<br/>韧性果决：内在韧性十足，遇事果断有魄力，但重大决策前需适当参考他人意见，学会变通。<br/>掌控欲强：表面随性洒脱，实则掌控欲强，在关键领域具有强烈主导意识。</p>'], 'love' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>身强癸水，喜用神为木、火、土。癸水如细雨滋润万物，身强时流动灵活，但有时力量过于发散。若能借助木火土之力，就能增强稳定性与行动力，让思维更清晰、工作更高效。</p>'], 'career' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<h4>财富运势</h4><p>适合老老实实上班、稳扎稳打赚钱，避免思维跳跃导致的资源分散。</p><h4>健康隐患</h4><p>注意肾脏代谢，避免摄入过多盐分；保护关节健康；注意睡眠质量问题。</p><h4>情绪管理</h4><p>易陷入极端思维，需通过登山/搏击等运动疏导能量。</p><h4>职业管理</h4><p>推荐行业：建筑与地产业：土木工程、建筑设计、房地产开发、工程监理、城市规划。能源与化工业：电力工程、石油化工、新能源。金融与法律业：法官、律师、审计师、税务师。科技与制造业：程序员、电子技术、机械制造、汽车工业。文化与创意业：作家、编剧、广告策划、导演、品牌管理、教育家。公共事业与管理：公务员、企业高管、项目经理。慎重行业：水产与航运业：渔业、水产养殖、航海、船员。贸易与流通业：进出口贸易、快递。</p>'], 'relationship_friends' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>戊土：戊土如城墙堤坝一般稳固，可以帮助你疏导过剩的能量，增强务实思维和抗压能力。</li><li>丙火：丙火可以激发你的行动力，帮你确定目标。</li></ul>'], 'relationship_couple' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>乙木：乙木能以智慧和柔韧调和你的强势，激发你的创造力。</li><li>丁火：能够化解水寒之气，使身强癸水增强情感包容力。</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_international' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Mother Teresa：诺贝尔和平奖得主</li><li>宫崎骏（Hayao Miyazaki）：动画大师，传递环保理念，个人捐资保护日本自然森林与文化遗产</li><li>Simone de Beauvoir：女性主义经典《第二性》作者，揭示\'女性是社会建构\'的真相，推动全球性别平等运动</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_domestic' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>王石：万科创始人</li><li>王健林：万达集团董事长</li><li>张朝阳：搜狐创始人</li><li>巴金：作家，批判封建礼教，晚年倡导建立中国现代文学馆</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_dailyTips' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>多听重金属音乐</li><li>嚼薄荷味口香糖可以平复情绪</li><li>多吃白色食物</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_color' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>黄色（土）：黄色象征稳固与根基，能增强癸水的稳定性，使行动更踏实可靠。日常多用黄色小物件，让力量更有支撑。</li><li>红色 / 紫色（火）：红色代表热情与动力，紫色象征果敢与灵感，能激发行动力，让癸水在关键时刻更果断高效。适度加入红紫色元素，使计划顺利推进。</li><li>绿色 / 青色（木）：绿色能将其细腻的智慧与感知力转化为才华、创意与表达能力。多使用此类颜色，有助于疏通思绪，激发灵感，避免身强癸水因过于敏感多思而陷入犹豫。</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_location' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>南方（火）：南方的能量象征动力与效率，能提升工作效率，让癸水在任务执行中更积极高效。</li><li>东方（木）：东方的能量象征生长与创造，能激发创新思维，让癸水在行动与决策中更具创意与前瞻性。</li></ul>']]]], 'version' => 1];
